      "widgets_values": [
        "## Iris-3B: instruction edit\n\nEdits an input image with an IrisEdit LoRA (in-context reference editing).\n\n- **ReferenceLatent on BOTH positive and negative**, fed the same encoded image. Without the\n  reference on the negative, CFG amplifies copying the source and the edit disappears.\n- **Negative text**: empty string.\n- **VAE**: `pixel_space` (Iris has no VAE; VAE Encode just converts the image).\n- **Size**: the output matches the input; ~768-1024 px works best.\n- **Sampler**: euler / simple, 30 steps, CFG 3, shift 3.5-4.\n"
      ]
    }
